{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53634","headline":"示柳珵（题拟） · 监空","name":"示柳珵（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兴一沙衰恒河沙，兔而罝，犬而拏，牛虎相交与角牙，宝檀终不灭其华。\n（《宋高僧传》卷二十《唐洛阳香山寺监空传》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"监空","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}